old me that it was Medusa, the Gorgon.","start":76.94,"end":82.48,"score":0.957,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-028-010","sourceId":"b2-028-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,12],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Jasper hopes that she will turn cars and their owners to stone.","start":84.14,"end":89.16,"score":0.968,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-028-011","sourceId":"b2-028-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,10],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"But none of them has been turned to stone yet!","start":90.26,"end":92.99,"score":0.987,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]}]}
